        "original_id": "6d1c129a-27dc-52e6-a727-b0af5deefba8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carla Gugino, Tom Berenger, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje\n- Films: Son in Law, Sin City, Night at the Museum, Mr. Popper's Penguins, San Andreas, The Space Between Us, Gerald's Game, Faster\n- Franchises and Systems: DC Extended Universe\n- Companies: Warner Bros.\n- Roles: Kelor\n\nFacts:\n- Carla Gugino was born on August 29, 1971, and she is an American actress.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the film Son in Law in 1993.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the film Sin City in 2005.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the film Night at the Museum in 2006.\n- Tom Berenger, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, and Carla Gugino appeared in the 2010 film Faster.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the film Mr. Popper's Penguins in 2011.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the film San Andreas in 2015.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the films The Space Between Us and Gerald's Game in 2017.\n- Carla Gugino played Kelor in the DC Extended Universe.\n- The DC Extended Universe is an American media franchise and shared universe centered on a series of superhero films distributed by Warner Bros.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
